== reads
main misses, replica not asked: none
archive answers a source miss: "archived"
but is never asked for a checksum: none
main down, replica answers: "stale"
main down, absent on replica and archive: unreachable

== writes with the main down
put: transient/link
replica owes nothing: 0 records

== deferred copies
owed before start: replica 3, backfill 1
no copy job left running: true
replica: chunks true true, manifest true, journal true, cursor true, index false
backfill: chunks true true, manifest true, journal false, cursor false, index false
after delete, replica manifest false

== a bulk delete reaches a copy as one
replica: 3 gone, by 0 single deletes and 1 bulk

== a manifest naming a chunk no main holds parks, degraded
the gate refuses it: corrupt/missing_chunks
replica parked: corrupt/other
backfill parked: corrupt/other
replica holds it: false

== a chunk that does not hash to its key parks its copy
parked: 4; replica holds the chunk: false, its manifest: false

== a chunk whose bytes are a manifest is copied as a chunk
replica holds it: true; parked: 4

== write guard
guarded write to the replica: transient/link
batch read with the main held down: unreachable

== conditional replace
an entry read from another member replaces nothing: changed, main keeps "on main"
with the main's entry: written
